# Attendance Management System

## API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Purpose |
|--------|----------|---------|
| GET | `/attendance/list` | Paginated employee attendance list |
| POST | `/attendance/mark` | Upsert single employee attendance/break |
| PUT | `/attendance/approve` | Bulk approve/override attendance |
| GET | `/leave/company` | Fetch available leave codes |

All require `company` header via `withCompany(companyId)`.

## Data Model

**EmployeeAttendanceRow**: `employee_id`, `name`, `shift` (ShiftInfo), `attendances[]` (AttendanceDayRecord), `calculations`.

**AttendanceDayStatus**: `'present' | 'absent' | 'leave' | 'half_day' | 'unmarked'`

**MarkAttendancePayload**: varies by status — present/half_day need times, leave needs leave_type+code, absent needs nothing.

**BulkApprovePayload**: `mode` ('actual'|'present'|'half_day'|'leave'|'absent'), `employee_ids` (array or 'all').

## User Flows

1. **Single mark**: Card status button → MarkAttendanceModal (pre-filled) → POST /attendance/mark
2. **Bulk approve**: Toggle select → floating bar → BulkApproveModal → PUT /attendance/approve
3. **Flag toggle**: OT/Deduct button → ConfirmAlert → re-POST with toggled flag (mutually exclusive)

## MarkAttendanceModal Props

`target.preSelectedStatus` — from card button click
`target.existingRecord` — pre-fill from current data
`target.shift` — default times from shift config
`leaveConfigs` — fetched from `/leave/company` on mount
